OL,3,GNEWSALeeds West Indian Carnival 2026:
OL,4,AWhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds West Indian Carnival is the
OL,7,Flargest Caribbean carnival outside
OL,8,FLondon, attracting around 100,000
OL,9,Fvisitors each year.
OL,11,FThe event began in 1967 and is held on
OL,12,Fthe last weekend in August, celebrating
OL,13,Fmusic, dance, food and culture.
OL,15,FAs well as the carnival parade on Bank
OL,16,FHoliday Monday, there are events going
OL,17,Fon in the run-up to the main event.
OL,19,FHere's all you need to know about
OL,20,Fwhat's going on, how to get there, and
OL,21,Fwhat not to miss.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
